OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,FNHS staff have been called "monkeys"
OL,7,Fand patients have refused to be
OL,8,Ftreated by non-white staff, amid a
OL,9,Freported rise in racism across the
OL,10,Fhealth service.
OL,12,FThe Society of Radiographers (SoR)
OL,13,Fsaid staff have reported a
OL,14,F"noticeable" rise in racism from
OL,15,Fpatients over the last 18 months,
OL,16,Fincluding patients calling staff
OL,17,F"dirty foreigners" and talking about
OL,18,F"people coming over here, taking our
OL,19,Fjobs".
