OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,FA new poll of SoR members revealed
OL,7,Fthat staff sometimes "accept" racist
OL,8,Fremarks as "something they have to put
OL,9,Fup with".
OL,11,FDean Rogers, executive director of
OL,12,Findustrial strategy and member
OL,13,Frelations, said: "The rise in
OL,14,Fincidents of racism over the last year
OL,15,Fand a half is unconscionable and
OL,16,Funacceptable ` and it's a poor
OL,17,Freflection on us as a society.
OL,19,F"The NHS has a diverse workforce `
OL,20,Fwhich is one of its strengths.
OL,26,@oD@VOUoD@]O]pD@LOUqD@HO]uD@ROU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
