OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,F"We are clear: discrimination,
OL,7,Fharassment, racism, bullying or
OL,8,Fintimidation ` whether expressed
OL,9,Fverbally or in behaviour ` is
OL,10,Funacceptable and has no place in the
OL,11,FNHS."
OL,13,FThe SoR is calling for the NHS to
OL,14,Frecord incidents of racism and monitor
OL,15,Fhow they are dealt with.JComments
OL,16,Freceived as part of the SoR poll of
OL,17,Fmembers include:
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@EO]
