OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,FPaul Awah, a Bedfordshire-based
OL,7,Fdiagnostic radiographer originally
OL,8,Ffrom Nigeria, said: "Patients claim
OL,9,Fnot to hear what I'm saying, or say
OL,10,Fthey can't understand me. English is
OL,11,Fthe only language I speak, and I
OL,12,Fbelieve I'm clear enough when I'm
OL,13,Fspeaking to patients."
OL,15,FOn three occasions patients have asked
OL,16,Fhim whether he has cannulated someone
OL,17,Fbefore when he has been called in to
OL,18,Fdeal with more complicated cases.
OL,26,@pD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
