OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785858502
OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,F"They're saying: 'If somebody who's
OL,7,FCaucasian has tried and failed, how
OL,8,Fdare you bring a Black man now?'" he
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FA sonographer of Asian descent working
OL,17,Fin the Midlands said that several
OL,18,Fpatients have said to her: "This
OL,19,Fcountry isn't the same, with all those
OL,20,Fpeople coming over here, taking our
OL,21,Fjobs."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@aO]zD@\OU}D@FO]
