OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,FShe said that racist incidents have
OL,7,Fincreased in the last 18 months,
OL,8,Fadding: "It's become more prevalent `
OL,9,Fit's in the media and certain
OL,10,Fpolitical parties and TV channels, so
OL,11,Fpeople are openly expressing their
OL,12,Fviews."
OL,14,FMr Awah added: "It's definitely got
OL,15,Fworse ` people are more expressive now.
OL,26,@pD@IOUtD@GO]vD@POU
