SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785858502
OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,F"What used to be something people
OL,7,Fwouldn't say ` now the rhetoric has
OL,8,Fchanged. Immigrants are blamed for the
OL,9,Fcost of living, energy bills, the
OL,10,Fworsening situation in the country `
OL,11,Fand people feel it's okay to say it."
OL,13,FMr Rogers added: "Racist behaviours
OL,14,Fundermine patient care and go against
OL,15,Four shared values of integrity,
OL,16,Fequity, courtesy and openness.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@eO]uD@ROU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
