OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785858502
OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,F"We want commitment and clear
OL,7,Faccountability when it comes to
OL,8,Faddressing anything that makes the NHS
OL,9,Fan unsafe environment in which to
OL,10,Fwork. Together, we want to ensure that
OL,11,Fthe NHS is safe, inclusive and proud
OL,12,Fof the diversity that makes us
OL,13,Fstronger."
OL,15,FFigures from the latest NHS Staff
OL,16,FSurvey, which was published in March
OL,17,Fshow he percentage of staff who have
OL,18,Fexperienced discrimination in the last
OL,19,F12 months from patients is at a five-
OL,20,Fyear high.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
