PN,31209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785858502
OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,FSome 9.26% of staff in 2025 said they
OL,7,Fpersonally experienced discrimination
OL,8,Fat work in the last 12 months from
OL,9,Fpatients or service users.
OL,11,FThis is up from 9.25% in 2024, 8.57%
OL,12,Fin 2023, 8.38% in 2022 and 7.91% in
OL,13,F2021.
OL,15,FThomas Simons, chief human resources
OL,16,Fand organisational development officer
OL,17,Fat NHS England, said: "Racist abuse
OL,18,Ftowards NHS staff is completely
OL,19,Funacceptable and has no place in our
OL,20,Fhealth service.
OL,26,@yD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
