PN,31210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785858502
OL,3,C'A poor reflection on society': NHS
OL,4,Cstaff report rise in racist incidents
OL,6,F"Our new national staff standards are
OL,7,Fclear that NHS organisations must take
OL,8,Fmeaningful action to prevent and
OL,9,Frespond to racism, support affected
OL,10,Fstaff and ensure there are clear
OL,11,Fconsequences for patients who racially
OL,12,Fabuse or discriminate against NHS
OL,13,Fstaff ` including the option to refuse
OL,14,Fcare in non-emergency situations."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@bO]
